{
  "lessonId": "L2M1L1",
  "title": "Trentino-Alto Adige 特倫蒂諾-上阿迪傑",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3498db 0%,#2980b9 100%)'><h1>🏔️ Trentino-Alto Adige</h1><p class='subtitle'>阿爾卑斯山下的雙語產區</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🗺️ Trentino-Alto Adige 產區地圖</h2><div class='map-container'><div id='trentino-map' class='trentino-region-map'></div><div class='map-legend'><h4>產區圖例</h4><div class='legend-item'><span class='legend-color' style='background:#3498db;border-color:#3498db'></span><span>Trentino-Alto Adige 大區邊界</span></div><div class='legend-item'><span class='legend-color' style='background:#f39c12;border-color:#f39c12'></span><span>S級 - Trento DOC 頂級氣泡酒</span></div><div class='legend-item'><span class='legend-color' style='background:#e74c3c;border-color:#e74c3c'></span><span>A級 - Teroldego Rotaliano DOC 紅酒之王</span></div><div class='legend-item'><span class='legend-color' style='background:#3498db;border-color:#3498db'></span><span>B級 - Trentino DOC 主要產區</span></div><div class='legend-item'><span class='legend-color' style='background:#5dade2;border-color:#5dade2'></span><span>B級 - Valdadige DOC 跨區產區</span></div><div class='legend-item'><span class='legend-color' style='background:#f39c12;border-color:#f39c12;border-radius:50%'></span><span>重要城市標記</span></div></div></div><style>.trentino-region-map{width:100%;height:600px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.map-container{position:relative;width:100%;height:650px}</style></section><section class='slide'><h2>🗺️ 雙重身份的產區</h2><div class='dual-region'><div class='region-half alto-adige'><h3>Alto Adige (Südtirol)</h3><p class='region-name'>上阿迪傑 / 南蒂羅爾</p><div class='region-info'><p><strong>語言：</strong>德語為主（70%）</p><p><strong>文化：</strong>奧地利影響深厚</p><p><strong>海拔：</strong>200-1,000 公尺</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>國際品種、精緻白酒</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Pinot Grigio, Gewürztraminer</p></div></div><div class='region-half trentino'><h3>Trentino</h3><p class='region-name'>特倫蒂諾</p><div class='region-info'><p><strong>語言：</strong>義大利語為主</p><p><strong>文化：</strong>義大利風格</p><p><strong>海拔：</strong>200-800 公尺</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>氣泡酒、Teroldego 紅酒</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Trento DOC, Teroldego Rotaliano</p></div></div></div><div class='key-fact'><p>💡 這是義大利最北的產區，1919 年之前屬於奧匈帝國，因此保留濃厚的德語文化。</p></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Alto Adige 五大白葡萄</h2><div class='grape-showcase'><div class='grape-item'><div class='grape-rank'>#1</div><h4>Pinot Grigio</h4><p class='grape-desc'>Alto Adige 的 Pinot Grigio 是<strong>義大利品質最高</strong>的，礦物感、結構感、陳年潛力遠超一般版本。</p><div class='grape-style'>風格：礦物、白桃、杏仁、高酸度</div></div><div class='grape-item'><div class='grape-rank'>#2</div><h4>Gewürztraminer</h4><p class='grape-desc'>發源地就在 Alto Adige 的 Tramin 村，<strong>最正宗的版本</strong>。荔枝、玫瑰、香料香氣濃郁。</p><div class='grape-style'>風格：荔枝、玫瑰、香料、低酸度、飽滿</div></div><div class='grape-item'><div class='grape-rank'>#3</div><h4>Chardonnay</h4><p class='grape-desc'>高海拔冷涼氣候造就優雅風格，常用於釀造高品質<strong>氣泡酒</strong>。</p><div class='grape-style'>風格：青蘋果、礦物、清爽、高酸</div></div><div class='grape-item'><div class='grape-rank'>#4</div><h4>Sauvignon Blanc</h4><p class='grape-desc'>展現清新的草本和柑橘香氣，酸度明快。</p><div class='grape-style'>風格：青草、醋栗、葡萄柚、高酸</div></div><div class='grape-item'><div class='grape-rank'>#5</div><h4>Pinot Bianco</h4><p class='grape-desc'>低調優雅，礦物感明顯，是當地人的日常選擇。</p><div class='grape-style'>風格：白花、蘋果、礦物、中等酒體</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Trentino 的驕傲</h2><div class='trentino-highlights'><div class='highlight-card trento-doc'><div class='doc-badge'>頂級氣泡酒</div><h3>Trento DOC</h3><div class='wine-details'><p><strong>釀造法：</strong>傳統香檳法（Metodo Classico）</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Chardonnay, Pinot Nero, Pinot Bianco</p><p><strong>陳年：</strong>至少 15 個月</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>細膩氣泡、高酸度、礦物感</p><p><strong>對比：</strong>與 Franciacorta 並列義大利兩大頂級氣泡酒</p></div><div class='price-point'>價格：€€-€€€（比香檳親民）</div></div><div class='highlight-card teroldego'><div class='doc-badge'>本土紅葡萄</div><h3>Teroldego Rotaliano DOC</h3><div class='wine-details'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Teroldego（本土獨有）</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Rotaliano 平原</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>深紫紅色、黑莓、紫羅蘭、巧克力</p><p><strong>單寧：</strong>中到高、結構感強</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>Trentino 的「紅酒之王」</p></div><div class='price-point'>價格：€€（性價比高）</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏔️ 高山風土的優勢</h2><div class='terroir-benefits'><div class='benefit-card'><div class='benefit-icon'>❄️</div><h4>冷涼氣候</h4><p>阿爾卑斯山的涼爽氣候保留葡萄的<strong>高酸度</strong>和<strong>清新感</strong>，避免過熟。</p></div><div class='benefit-card'><div class='benefit-icon'>☀️</div><h4>日照充足</h4><p>山谷地形集中日照，晝夜溫差大，累積<strong>風味物質</strong>和<strong>糖分</strong>。</p></div><div class='benefit-card'><div class='benefit-icon'>🌊</div><h4>乾燥風</h4><p>來自阿爾卑斯的 Föhn 風（焚風）帶來乾燥空氣，<strong>病害少</strong>、葡萄健康。</p></div><div class='benefit-card'><div class='benefit-icon'>🪨</div><h4>多樣土壤</h4><p>火山土、石灰岩、沖積土交錯，造就<strong>複雜礦物風味</strong>。</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📊 Alto Adige vs Trentino 對比</h2><div class='comparison-table'><table><tr><th>項目</th><th>Alto Adige (Südtirol)</th><th>Trentino</th></tr><tr><td><strong>語言文化</strong></td><td>德語、奧地利文化</td><td>義大利語、義大利文化</td></tr><tr><td><strong>主要白葡萄</strong></td><td>Pinot Grigio, Gewürztraminer</td><td>Chardonnay (氣泡酒)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>主要紅葡萄</strong></td><td>Pinot Nero, Lagrein</td><td>Teroldego, Marzemino</td></tr><tr><td><strong>代表酒款</strong></td><td>頂級 Pinot Grigio</td><td>Trento DOC 氣泡酒</td></tr><tr><td><strong>風格特點</strong></td><td>精緻、礦物、國際化</td><td>氣泡酒、本土品種</td></tr><tr><td><strong>價格帶</strong></td><td>€€-€€€€</td><td>€€-€€€</td></tr></table></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍴 配餐建議</h2><div class='pairing-grid'><div class='pairing-card'><h4>🍷 Alto Adige Pinot Grigio</h4><ul><li>🐟 烤鱒魚（當地特產）</li><li>🥗 Speck 火腿沙拉</li><li>🧀 山羊起司</li><li>🍝 奶油野菇麵</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h4>🌸 Gewürztraminer</h4><ul><li>🍛 亞洲料理（泰式、中式）</li><li>🧀 藍紋起司</li><li>🦆 煙燻鴨胸</li><li>🥘 香料燉菜</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h4>🥂 Trento DOC</h4><ul><li>🦪 生蠔</li><li>🍤 海鮮拼盤</li><li>🧀 Parmigiano-Reggiano</li><li>🍾 慶祝場合開胃酒</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h4>🍇 Teroldego Rotaliano</h4><ul><li>🍖 Tyrolean 香腸</li><li>🥩 烤牛排</li><li>🍝 肉醬麵</li><li>🧀 陳年起司</li></ul></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Trentino-Alto Adige 是義大利最北、最高海拔的產區</div><div class='point'>✓ Alto Adige 以德語文化為主，白葡萄酒品質極高</div><div class='point'>✓ Gewürztraminer 的發源地就在 Alto Adige</div><div class='point'>✓ Trento DOC 是義大利兩大頂級氣泡酒之一</div><div class='point'>✓ Teroldego 是 Trentino 的本土紅葡萄之王</div><div class='point'>✓ 高山冷涼氣候造就高酸度、清新風格</div></div></section></div><style>.dual-region{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px;margin-bottom:20px}.region-half{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.alto-adige{border-top:6px solid #e74c3c}.trentino{border-top:6px solid #3498db}.region-half h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.6rem;color:#2c3e50;text-align:center}.region-name{text-align:center;color:#7f8c8d;font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 20px;font-style:italic}.region-info p{margin:12px 0;padding:10px 15px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f8f9fa,transparent);border-left:4px solid #3498db;line-height:1.6}.region-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.key-fact{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffeaa7);padding:20px 30px;border-radius:12px;border-left:5px solid #f39c12;text-align:center}.key-fact p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.grape-showcase{display:grid;gap:15px}.grape-item{background:#fff;padding:20px 25px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-left:5px solid #3498db;position:relative}.grape-rank{position:absolute;top:-12px;left:20px;background:#3498db;color:#fff;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem}.grape-item h4{margin:10px 0 8px;color:#2c3e50;font-size:1.3rem}.grape-desc{margin:8px 0;color:#555;line-height:1.7}.grape-desc strong{color:#3498db}.grape-style{margin-top:12px;padding:10px 15px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ebf5fb,transparent);border-radius:8px;color:#2980b9;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem}.trentino-highlights{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.highlight-card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:30px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);position:relative}.doc-badge{position:absolute;top:-15px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#27ae60;color:#fff;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:25px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}.highlight-card h3{margin:15px 0 20px;text-align:center;font-size:1.5rem;color:#2c3e50}.wine-details p{margin:10px 0;padding:8px 15px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f8f9fa,transparent);border-left:4px solid #3498db;line-height:1.6}.wine-details strong{color:#2c3e50}.price-point{margin-top:20px;padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5f4e6,#a8e6cf);border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-weight:700;color:#27ae60}.terroir-benefits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:15px}.benefit-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:4px solid #3498db}.benefit-icon{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:12px}.benefit-card h4{margin:10px 0;color:#3498db;font-size:1.2rem}.benefit-card p{margin:0;color:#555;line-height:1.7}.comparison-table{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.comparison-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.comparison-table th{background:#3498db;color:#fff;padding:15px;text-align:left;font-size:1rem}.comparison-table td{padding:15px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;line-height:1.6}.comparison-table tr:hover{background:#ebf5fb}.comparison-table strong{color:#2c3e50}.pairing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}.pairing-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #3498db;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.pairing-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.2rem}.pairing-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2.2}.pairing-card li{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d6eaf8,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #3498db;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
  "quiz": [
